    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s easy to say \"there is hope\" but that feels like such a hollow platitude right now. it's not just about the money, it’s the time. i can't get those twenty years back. i spent my entire youth building something that just evaporated. i feel like a failed investment. like the math just doesn't add up anymore. what's the point of starting over from zero when you're already so exhausted?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
